{
    "title": "Woody Sort: Ball Sort Puzzle",
    "description": "Welcome to Woody Sort, a simple and addictive ball sorting puzzle game. Your objective is to fill each tube with the same colored balls. It may sound easy, but there is a twist: You can't put a ball on top of another ball with a different color in different drinking bottles. Enjoy this offline color sorting game and ball puzzle! Sort balls by moving them to different tubes! Relaxing brain puzzle game from the creators of the Brain Test brain teaser!\r\n\r\n\u2b50THOUSANDS OF LEVELS\u2b50\r\n\u27a4 Go on a journey with a level map that spans over 1000s ball sort levels. Balls come in different formations at each level in this color sorting puzzle. Sorting and filling the tubes require analytic thinking and strategic planning.\r\n\u27a4 Move up and claim great progression rewards to customize the ball sort game. Are you bored of classic water sort puzzles and ball sort puzzle games? Color Sorting puzzle is a fun and challenging ball puzzle color game with a huge breakthrough in the gameplay of sorting puzzles.\r\n\r\n\u2b50RELAXING GAMEPLAY\u2b50\r\n\u27a4 Woody Sort: Ball Sort Puzzle game features natural-looking graphics with wooden textures. Sort the colored ball bottles with the ultimate zen experience of the game's beautiful rustic graphics. Also, take a fresh look at the color sort games genre with leaves, wooden signs, and shining particle effects. Play without the internet - our free game lets you explore new worlds offline.\r\n\r\n\u2b50POWERFUL MECHANICS\u2b50\r\n\u27a4 Woody Sort: Ball Sort Game provides all the necessary tools to help players complete all ball and bubble puzzles. The reset button can restart a level that goes badly, or wrong moves can be undone with the undo booster. The game caters to all kinds of players with plenty of accessibility options.\r\n\r\n\u2b50CLASSICS OF COLOR SORTING\u2b50\r\n\u27a4 Water or liquid puzzle veterans will also find a place in Woody Sort: Ball Sort Puzzle, as we use the same sorting mechanics every player loves and enjoys. Tubes are ready for everyone to fill up! The game comes with refined, enhanced soda sort and color ball mechanics. Effortlessly switch the ball positions and match their color balls into sorting puzzle tubes.\r\n\r\n\u2b50ENJOY WITH FRIENDS\u2b50\r\n\u27a4 Leaderboards set the field for the players who are resilient and intelligent. Finish as much as puzzles you can to climb the ranks and show your name in the hall of fame.\r\n\u27a4 The weekly contests are another way of online competition. Play and collect as many stars as you can!\r\n\r\nHow cool is that, this is basically play-to-win!\r\n\r\n\u2b50CUSTOMIZE YOUR GAME\u2b50\r\nUse the new customization feature to configure bottles, balls, themes and plugs the way you want!\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY:\r\n* Tap on a tube to take out the top ball.\r\n* Tap on another tube to move the taken-out ball there.\r\n* Make your moves carefully to avoid getting stuck. Use the undo booster to cover mistakes.\r\n* Use the add tube booster to get extra tubes to help you sort the balls easier.\r\n* Pull the pin booster enables you to overcome challenging obstacles.\r\n* Finish the level by making minimum moves to achieve three stars.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n* Colorful graphics.\r\n* Relaxing and easy gameplay without restricting mechanics or time limits.\r\n* Good brain exercise and relaxing bubble sort.\r\n* Brain games and iq games are for improving the brain. You can play the best games offline.\r\n* A variety of bonus levels provide different gameplay options and exciting rewards.\r\n* Smooth controls. Easy tapping with color ball sort puzzles.\r\n* Fast animations. Flowing gameplay.\r\n* It can be played with one finger.\r\n* Safe for family play.\r\n* No internet connection is required.\r\n* Completely free to download and play\r\n* One of the best games in the world. Free offline games and nice games.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Woody Sort, a simple and addictive ball sorting puzzle game. Your objective is to fill each tube with the same colored balls. It may sound easy, but there is a twist: You can&#39;t put a ball on top of another ball with a different color in different drinking bottles. Enjoy this offline color sorting game and ball puzzle! Sort balls by moving them to different tubes! Relaxing brain puzzle game from the creators of the Brain Test brain teaser!<br><br>\u2b50THOUSANDS OF LEVELS\u2b50<br>\u27a4 Go on a journey with a level map that spans over 1000s ball sort levels. Balls come in different formations at each level in this color sorting puzzle. Sorting and filling the tubes require analytic thinking and strategic planning.<br>\u27a4 Move up and claim great progression rewards to customize the ball sort game. Are you bored of classic water sort puzzles and ball sort puzzle games? Color Sorting puzzle is a fun and challenging ball puzzle color game with a huge breakthrough in the gameplay of sorting puzzles.<br><br>\u2b50RELAXING GAMEPLAY\u2b50<br>\u27a4 Woody Sort: Ball Sort Puzzle game features natural-looking graphics with wooden textures. Sort the colored ball bottles with the ultimate zen experience of the game&#39;s beautiful rustic graphics. Also, take a fresh look at the color sort games genre with leaves, wooden signs, and shining particle effects. Play without the internet - our free game lets you explore new worlds offline.<br><br>\u2b50POWERFUL MECHANICS\u2b50<br>\u27a4 Woody Sort: Ball Sort Game provides all the necessary tools to help players complete all ball and bubble puzzles. The reset button can restart a level that goes badly, or wrong moves can be undone with the undo booster. The game caters to all kinds of players with plenty of accessibility options.<br><br>\u2b50CLASSICS OF COLOR SORTING\u2b50<br>\u27a4 Water or liquid puzzle veterans will also find a place in Woody Sort: Ball Sort Puzzle, as we use the same sorting mechanics every player loves and enjoys. Tubes are ready for everyone to fill up! The game comes with refined, enhanced soda sort and color ball mechanics. Effortlessly switch the ball positions and match their color balls into sorting puzzle tubes.<br><br>\u2b50ENJOY WITH FRIENDS\u2b50<br>\u27a4 Leaderboards set the field for the players who are resilient and intelligent. Finish as much as puzzles you can to climb the ranks and show your name in the hall of fame.<br>\u27a4 The weekly contests are another way of online competition. Play and collect as many stars as you can!<br><br>How cool is that, this is basically play-to-win!<br><br>\u2b50CUSTOMIZE YOUR GAME\u2b50<br>Use the new customization feature to configure bottles, balls, themes and plugs the way you want!<br><br>HOW TO PLAY:<br>* Tap on a tube to take out the top ball.<br>* Tap on another tube to move the taken-out ball there.<br>* Make your moves carefully to avoid getting stuck. Use the undo booster to cover mistakes.<br>* Use the add tube booster to get extra tubes to help you sort the balls easier.<br>* Pull the pin booster enables you to overcome challenging obstacles.<br>* Finish the level by making minimum moves to achieve three stars.<br><br>FEATURES:<br>* Colorful graphics.<br>* Relaxing and easy gameplay without restricting mechanics or time limits.<br>* Good brain exercise and relaxing bubble sort.<br>* Brain games and iq games are for improving the brain. You can play the best games offline.<br>* A variety of bonus levels provide different gameplay options and exciting rewards.<br>* Smooth controls. Easy tapping with color ball sort puzzles.<br>* Fast animations. Flowing gameplay.<br>* It can be played with one finger.<br>* Safe for family play.<br>* No internet connection is required.<br>* Completely free to download and play<br>* One of the best games in the world. Free offline games and nice games.",
